<p>So how do you actually put this all together? Forget those motivational videos telling you to wake up at 4 AM and study for 16 hours. You will burn out in exactly 4 days. You need a sustainable routine. You are preparing for Indian Coast Guard Navik GD, DB and Yantrik and aiming for Navik GD, Navik DB and Yantrik, which means this is a marathon, not a sprint.</p>

